e Filmmaker's Handbook\" by Steven Ascher and Edward Pincus**: A comprehensive guide to filmmaking, including video editing.\n2. **\"In the Blink of an Eye\" by Walter Murch**: A classic book on film editing, covering the art and craft of editing.\n\n**Communities:**\n\n1. **Reddit's r/VideoEditing**: A community of video editors sharing tips, resources, and feedback.\n2. **Video Editing subreddit**: A community of video editors discussing software, techniques, and best practices.\n\nThese resources should provide a solid foundation for learning video editing. Remember to practice regularly and experiment with different software and techniques to improve your skills. Good luck!",
