ce.\n\n**Additional Tips:**\n\n1. Book your tickets and dining experiences in advance to avoid sold-out situations.\n2. Plan your weekend strategically to make the most of your time and priority entry benefits.\n3. Consider adding behind-the-scenes tours or private meet-and-greets to enhance your experience.\n4. Don't forget to take advantage of exclusive VIP lounges and gourmet buffets to recharge and refuel throughout the night.\n\nI hope these suggestions help you plan an unforgettable theme park weekend!",
